                        "entry_id": "fc65de74-2a45-32b9-9866-89add9235c77",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not having been exposed to the sun."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b56d1eb7-3a01-4205-ba5a-6d64836b2d86",
                                "sense_id": "2aede27d-619b-3f67-b8b6-aba821463a3c",
                                "text": "[…] I thought her\nAs chaste as unsunn’d snow."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e625c8ce-f85c-40f5-9220-f407216de581",
                                "sense_id": "2aede27d-619b-3f67-b8b6-aba821463a3c",
                                "text": "[…] but day by day\nLife brings you nothing new or bright:\nThe bloom of boyhood dies away;\nAnd youth, unsunned by youth’s delight,\nYields place to manhood tame and drear—\nBlank year succeeding to blank year."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "389f4c92-6e85-4288-adc6-57a1d498a49f",
                                "sense_id": "2aede27d-619b-3f67-b8b6-aba821463a3c",
                                "text": "Presently after, he sat on one side of his own hearth, with Mr. Guest, his head clerk, upon the other, and midway between, at a nicely calculated distance from the fire, a bottle of a particular old wine that had long dwelt unsunned in the foundations of his house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b21642a3-c171-434b-b891-70992629f5c7",
                                "sense_id": "2aede27d-619b-3f67-b8b6-aba821463a3c",
                                "text": "This portion of basement was uncemented, low-ceiled, earthy, unsunned."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
